Generates proofs/conn.bend. The conn laws are checkers over a timeline of
Conn.step; each law's proof walks the same dispatch tree of Conn.step.ev
(tree.py: every def that matches a computed value, down to the moves), one
lemma per dispatcher, with the law's goal and leaf proofs (gen.py). The
hand-written parts are the .bend fragments. To re-prove after a change to
lib/conn.bend:

  cd bend/scripts/gen-conn-proof && python3 gen.py ../../proofs/conn.bend
